# Fire Lord Zuko: "Whenever you cast a spell from exile" (CR 603.2, 601.2a). Loan Shark is plotted on turn 1 with four Moxen and, on turn 3, cast
# free from exile after Zuko: the trigger puts one counter on Zuko (Zuko 3/5). A Memnite cast from hand does nothing, and the Shark enters from the
# stack, not from exile, so it does not trigger Zuko a second time. Zuko then attacks: "Firebending X, where X is Fire Lord Zuko's power" adds 3 {R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Loan Shark
Fire Lord Zuko
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Loan Shark.Activate(Ability: Plot)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fire Lord Zuko.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fire Lord Zuko.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Exile.Loan Shark.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fire Lord Zuko.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Loan Shark.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Fire Lord Zuko)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R} lasting {R}{R}{R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Fire Lord Zuko.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
